	<row id="msg_0524_T10R0301_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">FWAHAHAHAHAHA!\r*smoke bomb* *cough* *cough*\nI’m KOGA of the Elite Four!\rI live in the SHADOWS--a ninja!\nAlso my mama’s basement!\rMy style so confusin’, even I\ndon’t know what I’m doin’!\rFaded, passed out, food poisoned...\nI got the WHOLE pharmacy!\rPrepare to get finessed by my\nsinister techniques!\rFWAHAHAHAHAHA! *cough*\rIt ain’t about brute force--\nyou gon’ see real soon!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0524_T10R0301_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I threw EVERYTHING at you.\nEvery smoke bomb. Every trick.\rI gotta go back to ninja school.\rGo to the next room and\nsee what you deadass made of!\r*smoke bomb* ...I’m still here.\r</language>
	</row>
